 "words": 180,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Do not be shaken in mind or alarmed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "By a spirit or word or a letter",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying the day of the Lord has come",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let no one deceive you in any way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That day will not come until the rebellion takes place",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the man of lawlessness is revealed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He exalts himself above every so-called god",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seating himself in the temple of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord Jesus will destroy him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the breath of his mouth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring him to nothing",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the splendor of his coming",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His coming is by the working of Satan",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With all power and false signs and wonders",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wicked deception for those who are perishing",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They refused to love the truth and be saved",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord Jesus will destroy him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the breath of his mouth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring him to nothing",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the splendor of his coming",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God sends them a deluding power",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that they believe the lie",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But we must always thank God for you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chosen as firstfruits for salvation",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand firm and hold fast to the traditions",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May comfort and strength come to your hearts",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
